# Allow-list: only our own source and notes are tracked. Everything else stays local.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!MULTIPLAYER.md
!tools/*.py
!tools/dec.sh
!tools/rea-ps2
!work/scen*.json
!work/walk*.bin

# Never track (also covered by the allow-list; listed so they are never re-added by accident):
# game and console content: *.iso, PS2_bios/, work/extracted, work/dumps, work/scan, savestates,
#   screenshots (they contain game images), work/symbols.tsv (names pulled from the game binary)
# third-party software: tools/ghidra_*, tools/rea, tools/dl, tools/cb2util
# generated files: traces, logs, sockets, __pycache__, work/pcsx2_b (emulator profile with BIOS paths)
*.iso
*.bin
!work/walk*.bin
PS2_bios/
work/extracted/
work/dumps/
work/scan/
work/pcsx2_b/
tools/ghidra_*/
tools/rea/
tools/dl/
tools/cb2util/
__pycache__/
